                            {
                                "example_id": "e6a189f3-25e4-4d66-a847-b8a5b56090c3",
                                "sense_id": "30ce1ff1-9599-395d-903e-46c0c2ee824e",
                                "text": "— А ну их всех к чё́рту! — тоскли́во вскрича́л Пе́рсиков, выдира́ясь с ги́рей из толпы́. — Эй, таксомото́р! На Пречи́стенку!",
                                "translation": "\"To blazes with them!\" cried Persikov wretchedly, pushing his way with the ton weight out of the crowd. \"Hey, taxi! Prechistenka Street!\"",
                                "english": "\"To blazes with them!\" cried Persikov wretchedly, pushing his way with the ton weight out of the crowd. \"Hey, taxi! Prechistenka Street!\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
